<scb-header title="赛事图片与视频"/>
<view class="page fig-page media-entry">
  <view class="fig-summary">
    <view class="fig-summary-copy">
      <view class="fig-kicker">比赛影像</view>
      <view class="fig-summary-title">{{recentEvents.length ? recentEvents[0].name : '已公开赛事的图片与视频'}}</view>
      <view class="fig-summary-sub">从已公开赛事进入媒体内容</view>
    </view>
    <view class="fig-summary-mark media-summary-image"><image src="/assets/home/event-court.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/></view>
  </view>
  <view class="fig-card">
    <view class="fig-card-title">最近观看的赛事</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!recentEvents.length}}" class="fig-note">
      <view class="fig-row-title">还没有可查看的赛事</view>
      <view class="muted">打开主办方分享的赛事卡片后，可在这里直接进入该届的比赛视频与图片。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{recentEvents}}" wx:key="publicEventId" class="fig-row media-event" data-id="{{item.publicEventId}}" bindtap="openRecent">
      <view class="fig-row-copy">
        <view class="fig-row-title media-event-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.dateLabel || '已公开赛事'}} · 查看已发布媒体</view>
      </view>
      <view class="fig-pill">查看影像</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="fig-card">
    <view class="fig-card-title">赛事媒体</view>
    <view class="fig-row media-choice">
      <view class="fig-row-copy">
        <view class="fig-row-title">已发布回放</view>
        <view class="muted">以主办方实际发布为准</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="fig-row media-choice">
      <view class="fig-row-copy">
        <view class="fig-row-title">图片与视频</view>
        <view class="muted">按公开赛事查看</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="fig-card">
    <view class="fig-card-title">播放与分享</view>
    <view class="fig-note media-notice">
      <view class="fig-row-title">媒体来源</view>
      <view class="muted">仅呈现当前有效发布。未发布、已撤销或已到期的媒体不显示，也不会用示例视频替代。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="fig-note media-notice">
      <view class="fig-row-title">外部播放地址</view>
      <view class="muted">以当前有效发布为准。外部链接仅提供复制，不保证微信内播放。直播、云回放与转码按当前频道、授权和正式接入条件开放；未核验时不显示可用。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="fig-actions">
  <button class="fig-ghost" bindtap="open">去赛事页</button>
  <button class="fig-confirm" bindtap="openLatest" disabled="{{!recentEvents.length}}">查看赛事影像</button>
</view>
<scb-nav active="Events"/>
